   "status": "DISAGREE",
   "ruling": "Ruling: finding; i8582 p. 10, Part IV, Caution: \"Married individuals who file separate returns and lived with their spouses at any time during the tax year don’t qualify under the active participation rule and must use Part V instead of Part IV.\" This case (MFS, lived together late in the year) is classified in Part IV by rental.part4 = rental.active, so the project computes line 1b -\\$213.20 and line 2b \\$0; the hand-work puts the loss in Part V (line 2b -\\$213.20). BUG-0933. Severity high."
